{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SYTHookFormula","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTHookFormula","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnumerationFintype"],"declarations":1,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.numStandardYoungTableaux_eq_dimHLF_le4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.numStandardYoungTableaux_eq_dimHLF_le4","kind":"theorem","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTHookFormula.lean#L32-L41","doc":"**Hook-length formula on the genuine SYT count, for `n ≤ 4` (sorry-free).**  For every shape `l`\nwith `∑l ≤ 4`, the genuine standard-tableau count `numStandardYoungTableaux (ofRowLens l hl)` equals\nthe Frame–Robinson–Thrall hook dimension `dimHLF l`.  Composes the counting bridge\n`numSYTenum = numStandardYoungTableaux` (all `n`) with the `decide`-verified `numSYTenum = dimHLF`\n(`n ≤ 4`).  This closes `dimSYT = dimHLF` on the genuine count for the small-`n` range. ","signatureChunk":0}]}